abstract: >-
  A Rust CLI and shared Web runtime for runtime injection and lightweight
  pre-runtime development in accessible desktop Web UI contexts. Application
  validation is version-, platform-, route-, and page-specific.
keywords:
  - desktop applications
  - extensibility
  - code injection
  - Rust
  - Web UI
